---

<Layout 
  title="Calculadora de Numerologia de Nome Grátis — Sistema Chaldeu"
  description="Calcule o número do seu nome usando o antigo sistema Chaldeu. Descubra seu número da sorte, caminho de vida e muito mais. Grátis, sem cadastro."
  lang="pt-BR"
  ogLocale="pt_BR"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://namenumerologyhub.com/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="pt-BR" href="https://namenumerologyhub.com/pt/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://namenumerologyhub.com/" />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- JSON-LD FAQ -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": faqs.map(f => ({
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": f.question,
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": f.answer
      }
    }))
  })} />

  <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Background Glows -->
    <div class="absolute -top-40 -z-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 transform-gpu blur-3xl sm:-top-80" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="aspect-[1155/678] w-[36.125rem] bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-500 to-cyan-400 opacity-20 sm:w-[72.1875rem]" style="clip-path: polygon(74.1% 44.1%, 100% 61.6%, 97.5% 26.9%, 85.5% 0.1%, 80.7% 2%, 72.5% 32.5%, 60.2% 62.4%, 52.4% 68.1%, 47.5% 58.3%, 45.2% 34.5%, 27.5% 76.7%, 0.1% 64.9%, 17.9% 100%, 27.6% 76.8%, 76.1% 97.7%, 74.1% 44.1%)"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6">
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 to-cyan-400">Calculadora Gratuita de Numerologia de Nome</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Descubra significados ocultos, traços de personalidade e muito mais. Nossa calculadora usa o antigo sistema Chaldeu, que atribui valores com base na vibração do som de cada letra.
      </p>

      <!-- Calculator Input Form -->
      <div class="themed-card rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-10 mb-10 w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto border border-white/10 bg-zinc-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-xl">
        <form id="nameHubForm" class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <label for="primaryName" class="block text-left text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200 mb-2">Digite seu nome completo <span class="text-red-400">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="primaryName" required placeholder="Ex: João da Silva"
              class="w-full rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-base bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500"
            />
          </div>
          <button type="submit"
            class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-cyan-600 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-cyan-500 text-white text-base font-bold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-purple-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            Calcular Meu Número
          </button>
        </form>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Results Section -->
  <div id="resultsSection" class="hidden space-y-6 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-20">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 text-center">Seu Resultado de Numerologia</h2>
    
    <!-- Main Number Card -->
    <div id="mainNumberCard" class="themed-card rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-zinc-900">
      <div id="numberCardBanner" class="h-2 w-full"></div>
      <div class="p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-6">
          <div id="bigNumberDisplay" class="shrink-0 w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white shadow-2xl animate-pulse-glow">
